  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Lee Su-in has lived a life full of hardship, with no family and barely enough to get by. One day, she's suddenly swept into a contract marriage with Cha Dojun: CEO of the powerful LN Group and her childhood acquaintance. Having secretly harbored feelings for him for years, Su-in thought just being his wife would be enough; but Dojun is cold, distant, and doesn’t even step foot into their newlywed home. When Su-in finally reaches her breaking point and decides to end the marriage, Dojun begins to change…little by little. Could the love she dreamed of finally begin to bloom?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
